     - isEditMode derived from Model.Year != 0 (short composite key; 0 = add mode)
     - All input ids match HTML prototype exactly (yfdModalProject, yfdModalYear, yfdModalPPAcc,
       yfdModalCustomerIncome, yfdModalVLABudget, yfdModalSeedcorn, yfdModalPayCosts,
       yfdModalNonPay, yfdModalTestCosts, yfdModalAnimalCosts, yfdModalProjectSpecific,
       yfdModalManHours, yfdModalManDays, yfdModalManYears, yfdModalTotalCosts,
       yfdModalAdjustment, yfdModalAdjComment, yfdModalActualPact, yfdModalFixed,
       yfdModalDateFixed, yfdModalFixedBy)
     - TotalCosts displayed as read-only computed field (sum of cost columns)
     - yfdModalFixed is a checkbox mapping to Model.Locked (short 0/1)
     - DateCosted rendered with display text input + hidden ISO binding field
     - Hidden scalar fields: hdnYfdYear, hdnYfdProject, hdnYfdIsEdit,
       hdnYfdDateCosted, hdnYfdActualExpenditure, hdnYfdActualManYears
